{
  "native_artifact_sha256": "f9840098b37c4f7e32423007614a09a0d6008e48c9f15c1e09bc1cb260150e52",
  "sdk_segments": [
    {
      "text": "When I go to bed at, like, 1, you're still on my— You never go to bed.",
      "start_ms": 360,
      "end_ms": 5460,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 0,
      "token_end_index": 26
    },
    {
      "text": " Sleep.",
      "start_ms": 6600,
      "end_ms": 6900,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 26,
      "token_end_index": 30
    },
    {
      "text": " And just leave your computer on, maybe.",
      "start_ms": 7020,
      "end_ms": 8400,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 30,
      "token_end_index": 43
    },
    {
      "text": " He pretends. Always busy.",
      "start_ms": 10080,
      "end_ms": 11340,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 43,
      "token_end_index": 52
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, right. You know.",
      "start_ms": 11580,
      "end_ms": 12960,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 52,
      "token_end_index": 61
    },
    {
      "text": " So maybe.",
      "start_ms": 13620,
      "end_ms": 14280,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 61,
      "token_end_index": 65
    },
    {
      "text": " But I'm never online in the morning, so.",
      "start_ms": 14460,
      "end_ms": 16620,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 65,
      "token_end_index": 79
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah.",
      "start_ms": 17340,
      "end_ms": 17520,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 79,
      "token_end_index": 81
    },
    {
      "text": " Actually. Notice that. No one is.",
      "start_ms": 17700,
      "end_ms": 19260,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 81,
      "token_end_index": 92
    },
    {
      "text": " Right. All right.",
      "start_ms": 21660,
      "end_ms": 22800,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 92,
      "token_end_index": 99
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah. So.",
      "start_ms": 22980,
      "end_ms": 24000,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 99,
      "token_end_index": 103
    },
    {
      "text": " Okay. So I'll send it off to you, and then—",
      "start_ms": 24720,
      "end_ms": 28020,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 103,
      "token_end_index": 118
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, do what you want to do with it first, and. Then I'll—",
      "start_ms": 28080,
      "end_ms": 31200,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 118,
      "token_end_index": 141
    },
    {
      "text": " Sabotage.",
      "start_ms": 32340,
      "end_ms": 32880,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 141,
      "token_end_index": 145
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah. And I'll send it out to you again.",
      "start_ms": 33120,
      "end_ms": 36240,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 145,
      "token_end_index": 159
    },
    {
      "text": " Was there anything else we wanted to add to the timeline? I mean, essentially, it was what, like, you can't see. Either right there. Here's the old one.",
      "start_ms": 37500,
      "end_ms": 44820,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 159,
      "token_end_index": 213
    },
    {
      "text": " Oh, there's more.",
      "start_ms": 44880,
      "end_ms": 45420,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 213,
      "token_end_index": 219
    },
    {
      "text": " Well, that's your— it's this original one.",
      "start_ms": 45480,
      "end_ms": 47160,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 219,
      "token_end_index": 232
    },
    {
      "text": " Oh, this is the one that— okay.",
      "start_ms": 47340,
      "end_ms": 48480,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 232,
      "token_end_index": 242
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah. Yeah, it was just copied straight out.",
      "start_ms": 48480,
      "end_ms": 50520,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 242,
      "token_end_index": 255
    },
    {
      "text": " We probably want to think about it if we want to change— Our goals and stuff. I think one thing that we could probably skip. Totally is the removing things from the audio files.",
      "start_ms": 51960,
      "end_ms": 66780,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 255,
      "token_end_index": 314
    },
    {
      "text": " That's.",
      "start_ms": 66780,
      "end_ms": 66840,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 314,
      "token_end_index": 317
    },
    {
      "text": " Thought as well. I mean, do we—",
      "start_ms": 67440,
      "end_ms": 68640,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 317,
      "token_end_index": 329
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah.",
      "start_ms": 68700,
      "end_ms": 69120,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 329,
      "token_end_index": 331
    },
    {
      "text": " Are we actually going to attempt that?",
      "start_ms": 69120,
      "end_ms": 70500,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 331,
      "token_end_index": 343
    },
    {
      "text": " No. I don't think.",
      "start_ms": 70740,
      "end_ms": 71700,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 343,
      "token_end_index": 350
    },
    {
      "text": " I don't think so either.",
      "start_ms": 72060,
      "end_ms": 72780,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 350,
      "token_end_index": 359
    },
    {
      "text": " That's too big.",
      "start_ms": 72780,
      "end_ms": 72960,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 359,
      "token_end_index": 365
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah.",
      "start_ms": 73620,
      "end_ms": 73740,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 365,
      "token_end_index": 367
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah.",
      "start_ms": 73860,
      "end_ms": 73980,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 367,
      "token_end_index": 369
    },
    {
      "text": " I think that's going to be— we don't even know how to approach that at the moment, I think.",
      "start_ms": 73980,
      "end_ms": 77160,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 369,
      "token_end_index": 398
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah.",
      "start_ms": 77280,
      "end_ms": 77520,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 398,
      "token_end_index": 400
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah.",
      "start_ms": 77640,
      "end_ms": 77820,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 400,
      "token_end_index": 402
    },
    {
      "text": " It's a good thing. To have to say what we could have done if we had more time. Good future work thing, isn't it? Sticking the conclusion.",
      "start_ms": 78780,
      "end_ms": 84720,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 402,
      "token_end_index": 445
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah.",
      "start_ms": 85020,
      "end_ms": 85200,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 445,
      "token_end_index": 447
    },
    {
      "text": " To find. Reports. Should have we had more time.",
      "start_ms": 85200,
      "end_ms": 87720,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 447,
      "token_end_index": 462
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah. Yeah, yeah. That's right.",
      "start_ms": 88380,
      "end_ms": 89940,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 462,
      "token_end_index": 473
    },
    {
      "text": " That's true. Yeah. Unless we discover some sort of. Time warp thing.",
      "start_ms": 89940,
      "end_ms": 92460,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 473,
      "token_end_index": 494
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah.",
      "start_ms": 93180,
      "end_ms": 93360,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 494,
      "token_end_index": 496
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah. But that's definitely one thing. So maybe— I mean. We should— we should definitely— well, we could probably not put it under this heading, but put it under changes since the initial specification.",
      "start_ms": 94740,
      "end_ms": 103560,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 496,
      "token_end_index": 553
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah.",
      "start_ms": 104160,
      "end_ms": 104460,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 553,
      "token_end_index": 555
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah. And say, yeah, we didn't—",
      "start_ms": 104520,
      "end_ms": 106980,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 555,
      "token_end_index": 567
    },
    {
      "text": " We don't think—",
      "start_ms": 107100,
      "end_ms": 107700,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 567,
      "token_end_index": 573
    },
    {
      "text": " We decided that time is too. Short.",
      "start_ms": 107700,
      "end_ms": 110700,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 573,
      "token_end_index": 583
    },
    {
      "text": " Or we felt there were more important things to do with our time than—",
      "start_ms": 110880,
      "end_ms": 113580,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 583,
      "token_end_index": 601
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, something like that.",
      "start_ms": 113700,
      "end_ms": 114480,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 601,
      "token_end_index": 610
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah. To worry about.",
